<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, California 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament Wednesday:</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Anne Kremer (Luxembourg) beat 5-Mary Pierce (France) 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Magdalena Maleeva</p>
<p>(Bulgaria) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>3-Amanda Coetzer beat Melein Tu (U.S) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Sandra Cacic (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat 8-Lisa Raymond 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
